WEBVTT

00:13.520 --> 00:14.920
Come in.

00:21.360 --> 00:25.720
This old minister heard Your Majesty was hit by an arrow was greatly alarmed.

00:26.360 --> 00:30.560
Now seeing Your Majesty safe this old minister is at ease.

00:34.360 --> 00:36.027
This is Li Dingyuan's memorial.

00:39.480 --> 00:44.760
Your Majesty Your servant has verified everything the Xie family colluded with factions.

00:44.840 --> 00:49.880
Embezzled state taxes at every level originally two hundred taels of silver when it reached the court.

00:49.960 --> 00:51.627
Only one hundred taels remained.

00:55.160 --> 00:56.840
Take a look.

01:02.440 --> 01:05.107
You and I have been ruler and minister.

01:05.800 --> 01:08.560
Everyone has their own account in their heart.

01:09.880 --> 01:14.040
Others may not remember this bond but I.

01:15.440 --> 01:16.960
Cannot forget.

01:17.920 --> 01:21.240
These years what you've done.

01:21.840 --> 01:24.507
You and I both understand in our hearts.

01:25.840 --> 01:28.827
False accusation these are all false accusations.

01:31.640 --> 01:36.840
Your Majesty this old minister has followed Your Majesty since the second year of Yuankang.

01:37.400 --> 01:41.360
This old minister has never had disloyal thoughts toward Your Majesty.

01:48.160 --> 01:49.560
I.

01:52.360 --> 01:54.680
Have little time left.

01:59.880 --> 02:01.560
While I am here.

02:03.480 --> 02:05.280
I can still tolerate you.

02:06.920 --> 02:08.320
When I'm gone.

02:09.680 --> 02:13.240
Xuan Kingdom cannot tolerate you.

02:21.360 --> 02:22.760
Your servant.

02:23.920 --> 02:25.840
Your servant is guilty.

02:27.720 --> 02:30.840
Your servant is ashamed before Your Majesty.

